  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large stone bowl over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their moisture and start to brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the arborio rice and cook for 1 minute, until lightly toasted.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, lime juice, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the bowl with a lid, and simmer for 20 minutes, until the rice is cooked and creamy.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
